OL,3,AFrance braces for national day of
OL,4,Aschool protests after injuries and mass
OL,5,Aarrests
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance is braced for major protests on
OL,8,FTuesday, after organisers called for a
OL,9,Fnationwide day of action in support of
OL,10,Fstudents demanding more investment in
OL,11,Feducation.
OL,13,FIt comes after a week of
OL,14,Fdemonstrations, which saw students
OL,15,Fblockading hundreds of schools, at
OL,16,Fleast 190 students injured, and more
OL,17,Fthan 5,000 people arrested.
OL,19,FOne student had his hand blown off
OL,20,Fduring a confrontation on Monday, while
OL,21,Fanother was reportedly struck in the
OL,22,Fhead by a tear gas grenade last week.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
