OL,3,AFrance braces for national day of
OL,4,Aschool protests after injuries and mass
OL,5,Aarrests
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance's prime minister said the
OL,8,Fgovernment had announced measures to
OL,9,Faddress their demands, but the Union
OL,10,FSyndicale Lyceenne (USL), a major
OL,11,Forganiser of the protests, said the
OL,12,Fgovernment had offered "nothing
OL,13,Fconcrete".
